    "eligibilityModule": {
      "eligibilityCriteria": "1. Must have completed the PTI-125-04 study or Week 96 in the PTI-125-09 study.\n2. Male subjects must be willing to continue use of contraception during the study. With female partners of childbearing potential, male subjects, regardless of their fertility status, must agree to either remain abstinent or use condoms in combination with one additional highly effective method of contraception (e.g., oral or implanted contraceptives, or intrauterine devices) or an effective method of contraception (e.g., diaphragms with spermicide or cervical sponges) during the study and for 14 days after study drug dosing has been completed.",
